<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rockwell raised by Cowen.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rockwell raised by Cowen.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen said it upgraded Rockwell International Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 2-5/8 to 59-3/4.</p>
</text>
